985
00:41:09,728 --> 00:41:11,298
Gosh, the praying mantis startled me.

986
00:41:12,328 --> 00:41:13,428
Are you hurt?

987
00:41:14,028 --> 00:41:15,198
You hit it with all your might.

988
00:41:15,828 --> 00:41:17,337
- It was fine. - It must be startled.

989
00:41:17,338 --> 00:41:18,338
(Careful)

990
00:41:18,868 --> 00:41:19,938
Here.

991
00:41:20,338 --> 00:41:21,738
I let it go because I felt bad.

992
00:41:22,222 --> 00:41:24,092
(Thank you.)

993
