998
00:41:37,288 --> 00:41:39,487
- Three packets. - Okay. Our blood sugar is low.

999
00:41:39,488 --> 00:41:40,827
- Yes. - Ice melted a lot.

1000
00:41:40,828 --> 00:41:41,928
It melted a lot.

1001
