It felt prickly and ticklish because of the grass rashes.

1024
00:42:30,808 --> 00:42:33,507
- They got past the clothes. - That's right.

1025
00:42:33,508 --> 00:42:34,778
My skills have improved a lot in the past seven years.

1026
00:42:38,518 --> 00:42:40,448
