- Really? - Yes.

1030
00:42:48,488 --> 00:42:49,627
- It's okay. - Hyun Moo.

1031
00:42:49,628 --> 00:42:50,897
Come on. It isn't that bad.

1032
00:42:50,898 --> 00:42:52,097
- That's right. - I take care of my hair.

1033
00:42:52,098 --> 00:42:55,068
