Didn't you do it 20 times on I Live Alone?

1052
00:43:36,608 --> 00:43:38,937
- He loves the back wash. - I know. He does it all the time.

1053
00:43:38,938 --> 00:43:41,677
He has gotten more back washes from me than my dad.

1054
00:43:41,678 --> 00:43:42,748
Hold on.

1055
00:43:43,108 --> 00:43:44,178
It's cold!

1056
00:43:45,018 --> 00:43:46,178
My goodness.

1057
00:43:46,748 --> 00:43:48,548
Shouldn't we use the storehouse?

1058
00:43:50,188 --> 00:43:51,318
For goodness' sake!

1059
00:43:51,918 --> 00:43:53,587
(He squeezes his eyes shut...)

1060
00:43:53,588 --> 00:43:55,357
(and does Fathermoo a favour.)

1061
00:43:55,358 --> 00:43:56,688
He squeezed his eyes shut.

1062
00:43:57,658 --> 00:43:58,758
For goodness' sake!

1063
00:44:00,398 --> 00:44:01,528
I'll make more foam.

1064
00:44:01,928 --> 00:44:03,368
If I do this, I'll get more foam.

1065
00:44:04,698 --> 00:44:05,868
What?

1066
