1069
00:44:14,478 --> 00:44:16,778
His body has an expression.

1070
00:44:17,178 --> 00:44:18,348
It's always crying.

1071
00:44:19,178 --> 00:44:21,448
I speak my mind with my chest.

1072
00:44:22,218 --> 00:44:23,788
That's right.

1073
00:44:25,458 --> 00:44:26,558
Here I go.

1074
00:44:29,458 --> 00:44:32,098
Look at my shoulders. My shoulders look cool.

1075
00:44:33,698 --> 00:44:34,868
It feels nice.

1076
00:44:35,928 --> 00:44:37,067
It feels nice.

1077
00:44:37,068 --> 00:44:38,597
(She feels refreshed too.)

1078
00:44:38,598 --> 00:44:40,167
- What are we doing? - Oh, yes.

1079
00:44:40,168 --> 00:44:41,938
- It's so refreshing. - It's so refreshing.

1080
00:44:43,468 --> 00:44:44,608
How is it? How...

1081
