1095
00:45:22,678 --> 00:45:24,847
- A maesaengi clock. - Maesaengi's time passes.

1096
00:45:24,848 --> 00:45:25,848
(Maesaengi's spring days pass.)

1097
00:45:26,878 --> 00:45:30,817
I've watched the rise and fall of Hyun Moo's chest hair.

1098
00:45:30,818 --> 00:45:33,318
