1111
00:46:00,478 --> 00:46:01,847
There's hair on your nipples.

1112
00:46:01,848 --> 00:46:02,848
(Despite the passage of time)

1113
00:46:02,849 --> 00:46:04,458
- It's refreshing. - It's so refreshing.

1114
00:46:04,688 --> 00:46:06,787
