1134
00:46:50,068 --> 00:46:51,068
Mr. Suck-Up.

1135
00:46:51,298 --> 00:46:53,038
- Mr. Suck-Up. - Mr. Suck-Up.

1136
00:46:53,668 --> 00:46:55,367
Mr. Suck-Up of the musical world.

1137
00:46:55,368 --> 00:46:56,408
(Mr. Suck-Up)

1138
00:46:57,208 --> 00:47:00,538
