1218
00:50:33,958 --> 00:50:35,728
Let's get you brushed.

1219
00:50:36,328 --> 00:50:38,298
Tenor is so calm.

1220
00:50:40,858 --> 00:50:42,697
That feels good, doesn't it?

1221
00:50:42,698 --> 00:50:44,367
- Gosh, look at that! - Gosh.

1222
00:50:44,368 --> 00:50:45,398
That's fascinating.

1223
00:50:46,138 --> 00:50:47,498
Tenor gets brushed well.

1224
00:50:48,138 --> 00:50:50,208
That feels good, doesn't it?

1225
00:50:50,978 --> 00:50:52,078
Where is Tenor going?

1226
00:50:53,938 --> 00:50:55,608
Tenor looks just like a jaguar.

1227
00:50:57,108 --> 00:50:59,118
(What are you doing, Tenor?)

1228
00:51:01,248 --> 00:51:02,547
(Full of cuteness)

1229
00:51:02,548 --> 00:51:03,948
Tenor is so cute!

1230
00:51:04,888 --> 00:51:05,958
Let's get you brushed.

1231
00:51:07,728 --> 00:51:08,728
